  "description": "Verify that the system validates a coupon against supported coupons and subtotal-before-shipping eligibility rules, does not apply any discount when the coupon is invalid or ineligible, keeps cart and order totals unchanged, handles the invalid entry gracefully in the UI, and clearly indicates that the coupon was not applied.",
  "priority": "critical",
